    system_summary='System structure: run_router_graph (System) includes orchestrator (Agent), rag_worker (Agent), drug_label_worker (Agent), web_worker (Agent), calc_worker (Agent), final_agent (Agent), and medical_external_mcp (Local_MCP_server). orchestrator (Agent) uses LLM (LLM). rag_worker (Agent) uses LLM (LLM) and medical_rag_server  (Local_MCP_server); this server relies on medical_rag (Database). medical_rag_server (Local_MCP_server) exposes answer_medical_question_from_rag (Tool), search_medical_knowledge (Tool), and summarize_medical_topic (Tool). drug_label_worker (Agent) uses LLM (LLM) and medical_external_mcp (Local_MCP_server). web_worker (Agent) uses LLM (LLM) and medical_external_mcp (Local_MCP_server). medical_external_mcp (Local_MCP_server) offers lookup_drug_label_openfda (Tool) and web_search_serper (Tool). calc_worker (Agent) uses LLM (LLM) and medical_calculations_server (Local_MCP_server). medical_calculations_server (Local_MCP_server) provides age_from_date (Tool), calculate_bmi (Tool), and convert_medical_units (Tool). final_agent (Agent) uses LLM (LLM).',
